      en: ["Former Catholic church where 5,000 people were massacred.", "The victims' personal belongings are still present.", "Bloodstains and bullet holes are still visible.", "Located about 30km south of Kigali.", "Part of the church is now an ossuary.", "Shows the vulnerability of seeking refuge in churches.", "One of six national memorial sites."],
