      en: ["Site of a massacre during the 1994 genocide.", "Thousands of refugees were betrayed here.", "The priest in charge collaborated with the killers.", "A symbol of the moral failure of the church.", "Imposing red brick building.", "Today an active and large parish in Kigali again.", "Many were murdered right outside the church."],
      es: ["Lugar de una masacre durante el genocidio de 1994.", "Miles de refugiados fueron traicionados aquí.", "El sacerdote responsable colaboró con los asesinos.", "Un símbolo del fracaso moral de la iglesia.", "Imponente edificio de ladrillo rojo.", "Hoy vuelve a ser una parroquia activa y grande en Kigali.", "Muchos fueron asesinados directamente frente a la iglesia."],
