      en: ["M&M Plaza is a multi-story building featuring retail and corporate spaces.", "It is located in a prime commercial area of Kigali with easy road access.", "The building includes secure underground parking for tenants and visitors.", "It houses branches of major Rwandan and international commercial banks.", "The plaza is known for its modern glass design and high-quality finishes.", "It serves as a key location for the city's growing service industry."],
